    "text": "Tins of 2012, out in some countries in August and in North America in September, each with Mewtwo-EX BW45, Darkrai-EX BW46 or Rayquaza-EX BW47, all three with new art, four booster packs (usually two Dragons Exalted, one Emerging Powers and one Black & White) and a code card for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. The new art reached Japan in 2013, on prizes of Battle Carnival 2013 Spring and the Pokémon Game Show.",
